      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same outbox as 09, but the relay tails the WAL: no poll interval, no published_at, no cleanup.\nThe outbox table ends at 0 rows, yet all three committed events arrived, in order, as business events.",
      "originalText": "Same outbox as 09, but the relay tails the WAL: no poll interval, no published_at, no cleanup.\nThe outbox table ends at 0 rows, yet all three committed events arrived, in order, as business events.",
